The model weights in this folder were downloaded from the public Weights & Biases runs of
https://github.com/JasonGross/guarantees-based-mechanistic-interpretability
(see each model's SOURCES.json) and are redistributed here citing that repository's MIT license,
below. No separate license is stated for the trained weights. If you are the author and want them
removed or relicensed, open an issue and they will be replaced by a download step
(tools/import_gbmi_models.py).

